lls is empty. (c) The rider's own device track places the rider within 20.89 m of the pin at their furthest, across 67 qualifying fixes at 0.0 kph, well inside the 100 m presence radius for a STANDARD zone. Where all three hold, POL-NS-04 exonerates the rider and refunds the cancellation fee in full, with no driver compensation payable: a rider who is at the pin and trying to coordinate, and is met with silence, has done what the platform asks, and the failed pickup becomes a driver-side coordination failure. The concession in the driver's own case that no reply was sent and no call placed is accepted, and it is decisive against the fee rather than neutral. The rider's presence track also disposes of any suggestion that the rider was elsewhere.\n\nNothing is down-weighted, and I have checked POL-NS-08 expressly. There is no clock skew (the 'arrived' event at 10:06:17 matches a GPS fix); no trace defect (maximum gap 0 s across 84 fixes, rider track present); no chat defect (the two messages reconcile with trip_record.chat_message_count and the msg_id sequence is intact); and no fare defect (the cancellation-fee line of 4.50 equals platform_policy.cancellation_fee_sgd = 4.50). EV-ADVIS-02715-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0 with issue MISSING_ARTIFACT, but it carries no deciding fact here — the single unbroken 420 second in-geofence run needs no accumulation under POL-NS-06(i) — so it neither caps confidence nor displaces anything. The claims resting on it were discarded on the referee's disclosure check and are not relied on by either side's surviving case.\n\nNo escalation trigger fires. Confidence is above the 0.70 floor; no two admissible artifacts contradict each other on arrival, dwell or rider presence; neither profile shows the same-pair or abuse counters that POL-NS-09(c) and (d) read (both disputes_with_counterparty_90d are 0, rider no_show_disputes_30d is 0, driver no_show_terminations_30d is 1 of 134 completed trips, below both anti-farming limbs); and the sole